=== MDV-P2-006
title: Documents: upload, malware scan, secure viewer with time-limited links, scan to patient file (E-03)
type: Story
epic: MDV-P2-E02
prd: P2-07, P2-02
screens: E-03
priority: MUST
roles: Doctor, Nurse, Receptionist (upload only)
labels: documents, blob, security
estimate: 3
weeks: 11-12
depends: MDV-P2-004
confidence: 82 | Designed; AI extraction button is P5 (N-08) and stays hidden.
sources: design/Medvya Clinical Screens (E-03); design/Medvya Gap Analysis (Scan to patient file, SHOULD); PRD v2 P2-07
desc:
Upload PDF/images (desk scanner, phone camera, file) with type and source; stored in private Blob (CMK) with random keys; Defender for Storage / malware scan before availability; viewer streams via user-delegation SAS valid ≤ 5 minutes, watermarked with viewer and time; no download for reception; original file always kept; failed upload → retry.
ac:
- A file is not viewable until the malware scan passes; infected files are quarantined and the uploader is told.
- Viewer links expire within 5 minutes and are bound to the requesting user; blob names contain no PHI.
- Receptionists can upload and see the document list but cannot open clinical documents (policy test).
- Original files are immutable; metadata edits (type, date) are audited.
- Phone camera capture works on mobile web (multi-page to single PDF).

=== MDV-P2-007
title: Nurse intake queue and vitals with out-of-range re-measure and escalation (N-01)
type: Story
epic: MDV-P2-E03
prd: P2-03
screens: N-01
priority: MUST
roles: Nurse
labels: nurse, vitals
estimate: 3
weeks: 10-11
depends: MDV-P2-001, MDV-P1-028
confidence: 88 | Hi-fi interactive N-01 with flag rules and copy.
sources: design/Medvya Clinical Screens (N-01); docs/02-design/screen-specs.md#n-01-nurse-intake
desc:
/nurse intake queue (cards from "With nurse" column, Open intake) → /nurse/:id/intake: identity check, large inputs for BP systolic/diastolic, pulse, temperature, SpO₂, weight with previous value; out-of-range values flagged in words ("High · re-check", "Outside usual range", "+2.2 kg since …"), prompt to re-measure, then "Escalate to doctor" with reason (creates an urgent item on the doctor's Today). Chief complaint in patient's words.
ac:
- Values are validated for physiological plausibility (reject impossible values) and flagged against configurable ranges with text, not colour only.
- A flagged value requires re-measure or an explicit "keep value" before handoff.
- Escalate to doctor requires a reason and appears on the treating doctor's Today within 2 seconds.
- Saved vitals become OBSERVATIONs with source "Nurse intake", verified by the nurse, visible in Patient 360.
- Tablet-first layout with ≥ 44 px targets.

=== MDV-P2-008
title: Allergy verification and patient-reported medicines with handoff to the doctor (N-01)
type: Story
epic: MDV-P2-E03
prd: P2-03
screens: N-01
priority: MUST
roles: Nurse
labels: nurse, allergies, safety
estimate: 2
weeks: 11
depends: MDV-P2-007
confidence: 90 | Explicit rules: each allergy must be set; handoff disabled until confirmed.
sources: design/Medvya Clinical Screens (N-01)
desc:
Each existing or reported allergy must be set to Confirmed / Patient reported / Unknown / Not an allergy; new allergies can be added with reaction. Medicines captured as patient-reported (name, dose, frequency) or "Needs clarification" for unknown names. "Hand off · Ready for doctor" is disabled with "Confirm allergy status to hand off" until every allergy has a status; handoff moves the board card to Ready for doctor.
ac:
- Handoff is impossible (UI and API) while any allergy lacks a status.
- Allergy statuses and medicine statements store source (nurse intake, patient) and actor.
- Handoff updates the board and Today in real time.
- "No known allergies" must be explicitly confirmed; it is never the default.

=== MDV-P2-009
title: Consultation note editor: chief complaint, SOAP, specialty templates, manual note when recording is declined (E-04)
type: Story
epic: MDV-P2-E04
prd: P2-04
screens: E-04
priority: MUST
roles: Doctor
labels: notes, emr
estimate: 3
weeks: 11-12
depends: MDV-P2-004, MDV-P2-025
confidence: 85 | Hi-fi manual note design and SOAP structure exist; template content comes from MDV-P2-025.
sources: design/Medvya Wireframes (E-04); docs/02-design/screen-specs.md#e-04-manual-note-consent-declined
desc:
Note editor with sections (Chief complaint, Subjective, Objective, Assessment, Plan) per template; Objective prefilled from verified chart only (nurse vitals) with provenance; quick phrases and previous-note snippets; autosave drafts every few seconds (server-side, encrypted at rest) so refresh/network loss loses nothing. This is the non-AI baseline that AI must never break; in P3 the "Recording declined" banner reuses it without guilt copy.
ac:
- Drafts autosave and survive refresh, network drop and session timeout (restored after re-auth with patient confirmation).
- Prefilled content is only from verified chart data and is labelled with its source.
- Templates can be switched; switching preserves typed content in matching sections and warns about unmapped content.
- Note editor is fully keyboard operable and readable at 200 % zoom.

